{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "traderx-lmax-throughput",
  "title": "TraderX LMAX Throughput",
  "tags": ["traderx", "lmax", "throughput", "disruptor", "orders", "provisioned"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": ["1s", "2s", "5s", "10s", "30s", "1m"]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**These are in-process throughput gauges, not reconstructed Prometheus irate spikes.**\n\n- **Input disruptor throughput** = input events consumed through the input ring into the BLP.\n- **BLP throughput** = events completed by the single-threaded business logic processor.\n- **Output disruptor throughput** = output events consumed from the output ring.\n- **Trades/sec** = booked trades only.\n\nAll four are measured inside the matcher over rolling **100 ms** windows and exported as live gauges plus peak-since-restart gauges. Because the values are computed in-process, Grafana can show short bursts more accurately than panels built only from `rate(...)` or `irate(...)` on the service's own `/metrics` endpoint.\n\n**Important:** input-ring throughput and BLP throughput should be very close in healthy steady state because the BLP is the sole input-ring consumer."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Input Disruptor (current)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "max(traderx_input_events_per_second_current)" }],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } } }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "BLP (current)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "max(traderx_blp_events_per_second_current)" }],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } } }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Output Disruptor (current)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "max(traderx_output_events_per_second_current)" }],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } } }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Trades/sec (current)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "max(traderx_trades_per_second_current)" }],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple" } } }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Input Disruptor Throughput",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "max(traderx_input_events_per_second_current)", "legendFormat": "current" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "max(traderx_input_events_per_second_peak)", "legendFormat": "peak since restart" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        }
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
